{"config": {"stepGap": 200},
 "steps": [
  {"log": "DFM-Rscu steering home at low ground speed (about 2.7 m/s, 0.55 m per 200 ms GPS step), with GPS positions on the EX 0.001-minute grid. SensorE config DFM-Rscu/slow (fixture rscu-slow): the model turns with the aileron output O1 (up to 8 deg per step), which the fixture's mixes.jsn feeds from Rscu's steering (Lua control 3) at 100%, like the free mix in the emulator model, and MGPS 'Heading' is its true course. Rescue is flown twice from the same start, first with the heading computed from GPS points 3 m apart, then with the heading sensor; each time Rscu's heading and steering are sampled for 20 s on the way home"},
  {"waitForm": true},
  {"waitSub": 1},
  {"wait": 3000},
  {"expectState": "rscu.zeroLat"},
  {"expectState": "rscu.circleMax"},

  {"log": "setup: rescue on SA; heading sensor un-assigned for the first run"},
  {"setInput": "SA", "value": -1},
  {"link": "App Settings"},
  {"waitSub": 10},
  {"set": "Rescue mode switch", "value": "SA"},
  {"link": "<<<Back to main menu"},
  {"waitSub": 1},
  {"link": "Telemetry Sensors"},
  {"waitSub": 12},
  {"set": "Heading Sensor", "value": "..."},
  {"link": "<<<Back to main menu"},
  {"waitSub": 1},
  {"key": "KEY_ESC"},
  {"waitClosed": true},

  {"log": "run 1, computed heading: 1000 m out, flying away; rescue on, it turns for home"},
  {"sensorVars": {"xp": 0, "yp": 1000, "heading": 0}},
  {"wait": 3000},
  {"setInput": "SA", "value": 1},
  {"waitAudio": "rthenabled"},
  {"wait": 25000},
  {"log": "logged, not checked: on the 0.001-minute grid this heading jumps between a few directions (about 34 deg apart, measured 2026-11-25) and the steering swings with it. With exact positions (exPrecision false) it is steady to 0.1 deg, so the grid is the cause"},
  {"sampleState": "rscu.heading", "angle": true, "for": "20s", "as": "hc"},
  {"sampleState": "rscu.steer", "for": "20s", "as": "sc"},
  {"expectState": "rscu.dist"},
  {"setInput": "SA", "value": -1},
  {"waitAudio": "rescuemodeoff"},

  {"log": "run 2, heading sensor"},
  {"openForm": "DFM-Rscu"},
  {"waitForm": true},
  {"waitSub": 1},
  {"link": "Telemetry Sensors"},
  {"waitSub": 12},
  {"set": "Heading Sensor", "value": "MGPS_Heading [deg]"},
  {"link": "<<<Back to main menu"},
  {"waitSub": 1},
  {"key": "KEY_ESC"},
  {"waitClosed": true},
  {"sensorVars": {"xp": 0, "yp": 1000, "heading": 0}},
  {"wait": 3000},
  {"setInput": "SA", "value": 1},
  {"waitAudio": "rthenabled"},
  {"wait": 25000},
  {"log": "with the course from the sensor, heading and steering are steady (measured: spread 0.4 deg, steering within 0.07 deg)"},
  {"sampleState": "rscu.heading", "angle": true, "for": "20s", "as": "hs", "maxSpread": 2, "maxJump": 1},
  {"sampleState": "rscu.steer", "for": "20s", "as": "ss", "maxSpread": 2},
  {"expectState": "rscu.dist"},
  {"setInput": "SA", "value": -1},
  {"waitAudio": "rescuemodeoff"},

  {"log": "put the settings back"},
  {"openForm": "DFM-Rscu"},
  {"waitForm": true},
  {"waitSub": 1},
  {"link": "App Settings"},
  {"waitSub": 10},
  {"restore": "Rescue mode switch"},
  {"link": "<<<Back to main menu"},
  {"waitSub": 1},
  {"key": "KEY_ESC"},
  {"waitClosed": true},
  {"clearInput": true}
 ]}
